WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.373
[Warm ambient synth pulse begins]

00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:02.551
Working with PDFs in Python shouldn't feel fragile.

00:00:02.893 --> 00:00:06.129
Meet pyropdf — Python ergonomics, powered by a Rust core.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:08.246
Read text, tables, and Markdown.

00:00:08.568 --> 00:00:12.402
Highlight matches, fill forms, stamp pages, and render live previews,

00:00:12.452 --> 00:00:14.147
all from one versioned object store.

00:00:14.548 --> 00:00:16.572
Every edit runs in an atomic transaction.

00:00:16.894 --> 00:00:19.310
Undo or redo in an instant,

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.980
and if anything fails, your document stays untouched.

00:00:22.381 --> 00:00:25.586
Save incrementally to keep every original byte and signature.

00:00:25.948 --> 00:00:27.613
Zero required dependencies.

00:00:27.914 --> 00:00:29.003
MIT licensed.

00:00:29.424 --> 00:00:31.726
pip install pyropdf.

00:00:31.876 --> 00:00:33.565
[Warm synth chord resolves and fades]
